{"4397680": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Spell Sniffers", "steam_appid": 4397680, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Spell Sniffers</strong> is a third-person social deduction action game for <strong>1–8 players</strong>, where goblins must work together to keep their village running… while secretly hunting a wizard hiding in plain sight. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race to complete chaotic village tasks, coordinate through proximity voice chat, and trust your instincts — because one of you isn’t a goblin at all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Most players are loyal workers trying to secure victory, but one player takes on the role of the <strong>hidden wizard</strong>, quietly sabotaging progress and slipping through the group unnoticed until it’s too late.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will the goblins sniff out the spellcaster… or will the wizard survive to tell the tale?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Spell Sniffers</strong> is a game of messy goblin teamwork, suspicious sniffing, and wizard trickery — where finishing the job is only half the battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Spell Sniffers</strong> is a third-person social deduction action game for <strong>1–8 players</strong>, where goblins must work together to keep their village running… while secretly hunting a wizard hiding in plain sight. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race to complete chaotic village tasks, coordinate through proximity voice chat, and trust your instincts — because one of you isn’t a goblin at all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Most players are loyal workers trying to secure victory, but one player takes on the role of the <strong>hidden wizard</str